{{Quote|An anchor empowered by the spirit of a [[Terrorshark]], capable of forcefully dragging foes into the depths.|Item}}
The '''Shark Anchor''' is a {{Legendary}} [[sword]].

The Shark Anchor is an excellent choice for Sword Mains in [[PvP mechanics|PvP]], as it provides serious damage with moves that have low cooldowns and are easy to land. 

Although amazing on the ground, it loses some effectiveness in the air. However, it is not a major issue, as with practice, the moves can still be landed in the air consistently.

==Obtainment==
The Shark Anchor is dropped from defeating an [[Terrorshark#Anchored_Terrorshark|Anchored Terrorshark]]. Only the player who had their [[Monster Magnet]] consumed can obtain the Shark Anchor once they defeat the Anchored Terrorshark. The player has to also deal at least 10% of the damage to the Anchored Terrorshark.

A system message will appear ("'''''Your Monster Magnet has attracted an irregular beast...'''''") upon consumption of the [[Monster Magnet]].

[[File:TerrorsharkWithAnchor.png|none|thumb|A [[Terrorshark]] that has consumed the [[Monster Magnet]].]]

